ext","url":"/garage/Frameworks#supported-frameworks","content":"Free text"},"454":{"id":"/garage/Frameworks-39","page_id":"/garage/Frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Frameworks#supported-frameworks","content":"Free text"},"455":{"id":"/garage/Frameworks-40","page_id":"/garage/Frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Frameworks#supported-frameworks","content":"**On duty check**"},"456":{"id":"/garage/Frameworks-41","page_id":"/garage/Frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Frameworks#supported-frameworks","content":"Yes"},"457":{"id":"/garage/Frameworks-42","page_id":"/garage/Frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Frameworks#supported-frameworks","content":"Yes"},"458":{"id":"/garage/Frameworks-43","page_id":"/garage/Frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Frameworks#supported-frameworks","content":"Always on duty"},"459":{"id":"/garage/Frameworks-44","page_id":"/garage/Frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Frameworks#supported-frameworks","content":"Always on duty"},"460":{"id":"/garage/Frameworks-45","page_id":"/garage/Frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Frameworks#supported-frameworks","content":"**ESX:** the script adds a `parking` column to `owned_vehicles` on the first start, and reads the `vehicles` table to turn the model hash back into a spawn name. A car whose model is missing from the `vehicles` table can't be spawned and stays hidden; the console tells you which plate it is."},"461":{"id":"/garage/Frameworks-46","page_id":"/garage/Frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Frameworks#supported-frameworks","content":"**ox\\_core:** groups are used as jobs. A player's job is the group with the highest grade."},"462":{"id":"/garage/Frameworks-47","page_id":"/garage/Frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Frameworks#customizing-a-bridge","content":"Open the bridge file of your framework, e.g. `modules/creator/bridge/qbox.lua`, and change the function you need. Two common examples:"},"463":{"id":"/garage/Frameworks-48","page_id":"/garage/Frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Frameworks#customizing-a-bridge","content":"ESX has no key system of its own, so `GiveKeys` is empty. Add the call of your lock resource:"},"464":{"id":"/garage/Frameworks-49","page_id":"/garage/Frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Frameworks#customizing-a-bridge","content":"`TakePayment` is used for the impound release fee. Return `true` only when the money was taken:"},"465":{"id":"/garage/Frameworks-50","page_id":"/garage/Frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Frameworks#customizing-a-bridge","content":"**Never spawn, move or delete vehicles from a bridge.** Only `GetVehicle`, `GetVehicles` and the database updates may yield; every other function has to return straight away."},"466":{"id":"/garage/Frameworks-51","page_id":"/garage/Frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Frameworks#customizing-a-bridge","content":"**Custom framework?** Pick the bridge that is closest to yours, set `Framework` to that name in `config.lua`, and rewrite its functions. Remove the `AssertReady` checks for resources you don't run."},"467":{"id":"/garage/Frameworks-52","page_id":"/garage/Frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Frameworks#bridge-reference","content":"Every bridge fills the global `EvolentGarageBridge` table with the functions below."},"468":{"id":"/garage/Manager","page_id":"/garage/Manager","type":"page","content":"Garage Manager","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Garage"],"tags":[],"url":"/garage/Manager"},"469":{"id":"/garage/Manager-0","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager","content":"Create and manage garages, the brand and the settings in game."},"470":{"id":"/garage/Manager-1","page_id":"/garage/Manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/garage/Manager#create-a-garage","content":"Create a Garage"},"471":{"id":"/garage/Manager-2","page_id":"/garage/Manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/garage/Manager#garage-details","content":"Garage Details"},"472":{"id":"/garage/Manager-3","page_id":"/garage/Manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/garage/Manager#place-in-the-world","content":"Place in the World"},"473":{"id":"/garage/Manager-4","page_id":"/garage/Manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/garage/Manager#who-can-use-it","content":"Who Can Use It"},"474":{"id":"/garage/Manager-5","page_id":"/garage/Manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/garage/Manager#save","content":"Save"},"475":{"id":"/garage/Manager-6","page_id":"/garage/Manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/garage/Manager#placement-rules","content":"Placement Rules"},"476":{"id":"/garage/Manager-7","page_id":"/garage/Manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/garage/Manager#vehicle-storage","content":"Vehicle Storage"},"477":{"id":"/garage/Manager-8","page_id":"/garage/Manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/garage/Manager#impound-garages","content":"Impound Garages"},"478":{"id":"/garage/Manager-9","page_id":"/garage/Manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/garage/Manager#brand","content":"Brand"},"479":{"id":"/garage/Manager-10","page_id":"/garage/Manager","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/garage/Manager#settings","content":"Settings"},"480":{"id":"/garage/Manager-11","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager","content":"The Garage Manager is where you build and look after your garages. There is no garage list in `config.lua`: every garage is created in game and saved instantly, **no restart needed**."},"481":{"id":"/garage/Manager-12","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager","content":"Open it with `/evgarage`. You need the ACE permission set in `Garage.ManageAce`:"},"482":{"id":"/garage/Manager-13","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager","content":"The start screen lists **Your Garages** and gives you three buttons: **Add new garage**, **Brand** and **Settings**."},"483":{"id":"/garage/Manager-14","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#garage-details","content":"**Display name**: the name players see on the terminal and the map blip (2 to 60 characters)."},"484":{"id":"/garage/Manager-15","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#garage-details","content":"**Vehicle storage**: which stored vehicles the terminal shows. See Vehicle Storage below."},"485":{"id":"/garage/Manager-16","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#garage-details","content":"**Impound garage**: tick this to turn the garage into an impound. See Impound Garages below."},"486":{"id":"/garage/Manager-17","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#place-in-the-world","content":"Press **Place lift**, then **Place terminal**. A free camera opens so you can put each part exactly where you want it, with a live preview."},"487":{"id":"/garage/Manager-18","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#place-in-the-world","content":"Key"},"488":{"id":"/garage/Manager-19","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#place-in-the-world","content":"Action"},"489":{"id":"/garage/Manager-20","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#place-in-the-world","content":"`W` `A` `S` `D`"},"490":{"id":"/garage/Manager-21","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#place-in-the-world","content":"Move camera"},"491":{"id":"/garage/Manager-22","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#place-in-the-world","content":"`Q` / `E`"},"492":{"id":"/garage/Manager-23","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#place-in-the-world","content":"Camera down / up"},"493":{"id":"/garage/Manager-24","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#place-in-the-world","content":"`Mouse`"},"494":{"id":"/garage/Manager-25","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#place-in-the-world","content":"Look around"},"495":{"id":"/garage/Manager-26","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#place-in-the-world","content":"`Shift`"},"496":{"id":"/garage/Manager-27","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#place-in-the-world","content":"Move faster"},"497":{"id":"/garage/Manager-28","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#place-in-the-world","content":"`Mouse Wheel`"},"498":{"id":"/garage/Manager-29","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#place-in-the-world","content":"Rotate preview"},"499":{"id":"/garage/Manager-30","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#place-in-the-world","content":"`Alt`"},"500":{"id":"/garage/Manager-31","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#place-in-the-world","content":"Fine rotation"},"501":{"id":"/garage/Manager-32","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#place-in-the-world","content":"`PgUp` / `PgDn`"},"502":{"id":"/garage/Manager-33","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#place-in-the-world","content":"Preview height"},"503":{"id":"/garage/Manager-34","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#place-in-the-world","content":"`Enter`"},"504":{"id":"/garage/Manager-35","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#place-in-the-world","content":"Confirm position"},"505":{"id":"/garage/Manager-36","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#place-in-the-world","content":"`Esc`"},"506":{"id":"/garage/Manager-37","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#place-in-the-world","content":"Cancel"},"507":{"id":"/garage/Manager-38","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#place-in-the-world","content":"Keep the **blue exit arrow** clear when placing the lift. That is the way the car drives out, so point it at an open parking area and aim at level ground."},"508":{"id":"/garage/Manager-39","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#place-in-the-world","content":"Below the placement you can also switch on:"},"509":{"id":"/garage/Manager-40","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#place-in-the-world","content":"**Rear lift door**: adds a second shutter at the back. Both doors open and close together."},"510":{"id":"/garage/Manager-41","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#place-in-the-world","content":"**Map blip**: show this garage on the map."},"511":{"id":"/garage/Manager-42","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#who-can-use-it","content":"With **no jobs** in the list, the garage is **public** and everyone can use it."},"512":{"id":"/garage/Manager-43","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#who-can-use-it","content":"Press **Add job** to restrict it. Each job has its own **minimum grade**, and a garage can list up to 12 jobs."},"513":{"id":"/garage/Manager-44","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#who-can-use-it","content":"Tick **On duty only** to require players to be on duty for one of the listed jobs."},"514":{"id":"/garage/Manager-45","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#save","content":"Press **Save garage**. The lift and terminal appear for every player straight away."},"515":{"id":"/garage/Manager-46","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#placement-rules","content":"A garage is refused when it breaks one of these rules. The manager tells you which one."},"516":{"id":"/garage/Manager-47","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#placement-rules","content":"The terminal must be **2.5 to 20 metres** from the lift centre, and **outside** the lift footprint and its safety margin."},"517":{"id":"/garage/Manager-48","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#placement-rules","content":"Lift centres must be at least **9 metres** apart."},"518":{"id":"/garage/Manager-49","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#placement-rules","content":"The ground under the lift must be level. The allowed difference can be raised under **Settings** > **Advanced**, see Configuration."},"519":{"id":"/garage/Manager-50","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#placement-rules","content":"A server can have up to **50 garages**."},"520":{"id":"/garage/Manager-51","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#placement-rules","content":"A garage can't be edited or deleted while its lift is running a cycle."},"521":{"id":"/garage/Manager-52","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#vehicle-storage","content":"Every garage stores its vehicles under a **storage name**, which is written to the `garage` column of your framework's vehicle table."},"522":{"id":"/garage/Manager-53","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#vehicle-storage","content":"**Leave it empty** to give the garage its own dedicated storage (`evolent:<garage id>`)."},"523":{"id":"/garage/Manager-54","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#vehicle-storage","content":"**Pick an existing garage** from the suggestions to share its vehicles. The lift then shows every car parked in, for example, `pillboxgarage` of your current garage script, and cars stored at the lift show up there too."},"524":{"id":"/garage/Manager-55","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#vehicle-storage","content":"**Use the same name on several lifts** to let them share one storage."},"525":{"id":"/garage/Manager-56","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#vehicle-storage","content":"Suggestions come from `qbx_garages` on Qbox and from `QBCore.Shared.Garages` on QBCore. On ESX and ox\\_core you can type any storage name yourself."},"526":{"id":"/garage/Manager-57","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#impound-garages","content":"Tick **Impound garage** and set a **Release fee** to turn a garage into an impound."},"527":{"id":"/garage/Manager-58","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#impound-garages","content":"An impound **hands vehicles back for a fee** and **takes none in**. The *Store vehicle* option is not offered at an impound terminal."},"528":{"id":"/garage/Manager-59","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#impound-garages","content":"The fee is taken from the player's **bank**, and from their **cash** when the bank can't cover it. On ox\\_core it is taken as the `money` item. The car only leaves once the fee is paid."},"529":{"id":"/garage/Manager-60","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#impound-garages","content":"An impound gets its own map blip (`Blips.ImpoundSprite` / `Blips.ImpoundColour`)."},"530":{"id":"/garage/Manager-61","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#impound-garages","content":"When `LostVehicles.Garage` is `'impound'`, lost vehicles are sent here. With more than one impound garage, the first one by garage ID is used."},"531":{"id":"/garage/Manager-62","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#impound-garages","content":"Vehicles your own impound or police script has impounded (state `2` on QB / Qbox) are **never touched** by this script."},"532":{"id":"/garage/Manager-63","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#brand","content":"Press **Brand** to change the look of every terminal and of the manager itself. Saving applies it to all players at once."},"533":{"id":"/garage/Manager-64","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#brand","content":"**Colour**: the accent colour of the terminal and manager."},"534":{"id":"/garage/Manager-65","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#brand","content":"**Lights in the garage and on the terminal**: a separate colour for the cabin light and the terminal strips, or *Same as the brand colour*."},"535":{"id":"/garage/Manager-66","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#brand","content":"**Logo**: upload a picture or use an `https://` link. **Use the default logo** puts the original back."},"536":{"id":"/garage/Manager-67","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#brand","content":"**Text next to the logo**: your garage brand name. Select letters and pick a weight (Regular, Medium, Semibold, Bold), italic or underline."},"537":{"id":"/garage/Manager-68","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#brand","content":"**Reset to config.lua** throws the in-game brand away and uses the `Brand` section of `config.lua` again."},"538":{"id":"/garage/Manager-69","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#settings","content":"Press **Settings** to change how the garages behave. Values are grouped in **Terminal**, **Lift**, **Vehicles**, **Map & sound**, **Lights**, **Messages** and **Advanced**, and every row explains what it does."},"539":{"id":"/garage/Manager-70","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#settings","content":"**Save settings** applies the changes to every player straight away. Only the language needs a restart."},"540":{"id":"/garage/Manager-71","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#settings","content":"**Reset** on a single row, or **Reset everything to config.lua**, puts the `config.lua` value back."},"541":{"id":"/garage/Manager-72","page_id":"/garage/Manager","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Manager#settings","content":"The meaning, default and limits of each value are listed on the Configuration page."},"542":{"id":"/garage/Usage","page_id":"/garage/Usage","type":"page","content":"Using Garages","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Garage"],"tags":[],"url":"/garage/Usage"},"543":{"id":"/garage/Usage-0","page_id":"/garage/Usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Usage","content":"How players collect and store vehicles, and how lost vehicles are recovered."},"544":{"id":"/garage/Usage-1","page_id":"/garage/Usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/garage/Usage#collect-a-vehicle","content":"Collect a Vehicle"},"545":{"id":"/garage/Usage-2","page_id":"/garage/Usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/garage/Usage#pick-a-vehicle","content":"Pick a Vehicle"},"546":{"id":"/garage/Usage-3","page_id":"/garage/Usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/garage/Usage#wait-for-the-lift","content":"Wait for the Lift"},"547":{"id":"/garage/Usage-4","page_id":"/garage/Usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/garage/Usage#drive-out","content":"Drive Out"},"548":{"id":"/garage/Usage-5","page_id":"/garage/Usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/garage/Usage#store-a-vehicle","content":"Store a Vehicle"},"549":{"id":"/garage/Usage-6","page_id":"/garage/Usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/garage/Usage#park-nearby","content":"Park Nearby"},"550":{"id":"/garage/Usage-7","page_id":"/garage/Usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/garage/Usage#choose-store-vehicle","content":"Choose Store Vehicle"},"551":{"id":"/garage/Usage-8","page_id":"/garage/Usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/garage/Usage#drive-onto-the-lift","content":"Drive onto the Lift"},"552":{"id":"/garage/Usage-9","page_id":"/garage/Usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/garage/Usage#which-vehicles-fit","content":"Which Vehicles Fit"},"553":{"id":"/garage/Usage-10","page_id":"/garage/Usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/garage/Usage#lost-vehicles","content":"Lost Vehicles"},"554":{"id":"/garage/Usage-11","page_id":"/garage/Usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/garage/Usage#good-to-know","content":"Good to Know"},"555":{"id":"/garage/Usage-12","page_id":"/garage/Usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Usage","content":"This page explains how players use a garage, so you know what to expect and what to tell your community."},"556":{"id":"/garage/Usage-13","page_id":"/garage/Usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Usage","content":"Players open the terminal by walking up to it and using **ox\\_target** (*Use garage terminal*) or the key prompt (**E** by default). The terminal shows the vehicles stored in this garage and the owned vehicles that are parked nearby."},"557":{"id":"/garage/Usage-14","page_id":"/garage/Usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Usage#pick-a-vehicle","content":"Open the terminal and select a car under **Your Vehicles**. Fuel, engine and body condition are shown for each one. At an impound, the release fee is shown and paid here."},"558":{"id":"/garage/Usage-15","page_id":"/garage/Usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Usage#wait-for-the-lift","content":"The shutters open and the platform brings the car up from below. The keys are handed over automatically when your key script is supported (see Frameworks)."},"559":{"id":"/garage/Usage-16","page_id":"/garage/Usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Usage#drive-out","content":"Get in and drive the car off the lift. Changed your mind? Choose **Return your vehicle** on the terminal and it goes back down."},"560":{"id":"/garage/Usage-17","page_id":"/garage/Usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Usage#drive-out","content":"A collected car that is not driven off within `Movement.PickupTimeout` (3 minutes by default) goes back into storage by itself."},"561":{"id":"/garage/Usage-18","page_id":"/garage/Usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Usage#park-nearby","content":"Park your car near the garage and **step out**. Only owned cars within `StoreNearby.Lift` (18 m by default) of the lift are listed."},"562":{"id":"/garage/Usage-19","page_id":"/garage/Usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Usage#choose-store-vehicle","content":"Open the terminal and select the car under **Store vehicle**. The empty lift rises and the shutters open."},"563":{"id":"/garage/Usage-20","page_id":"/garage/Usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Usage#drive-onto-the-lift","content":"Drive fully onto the raised lift, stop, and step outside. Storage starts automatically and the car is saved with its mods, fuel and damage."},"564":{"id":"/garage/Usage-21","page_id":"/garage/Usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Usage#drive-onto-the-lift","content":"Players who forget how it works can type `/evpark` for a short in-game reminder."},"565":{"id":"/garage/Usage-22","page_id":"/garage/Usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Usage#which-vehicles-fit","content":"Cars and motorbikes can be stored."},"566":{"id":"/garage/Usage-23","page_id":"/garage/Usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Usage#which-vehicles-fit","content":"Bicycles, boats, helicopters, planes and trains can't."},"567":{"id":"/garage/Usage-24","page_id":"/garage/Usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Usage#which-vehicles-fit","content":"The vehicle must fit inside the lift cabin: at most **2.85 m wide**, **6.25 m long** and **2.80 m high**. Larger vehicles are refused with *This vehicle does not fit inside the lift*."},"568":{"id":"/garage/Usage-25","page_id":"/garage/Usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Usage#lost-vehicles","content":"A car can end up marked as *out* in the database while it no longer exists in the world, for example after a despawn, a crash or a server restart. With `LostVehicles.Enabled`, these cars are brought back automatically when the owner opens a terminal."},"569":{"id":"/garage/Usage-26","page_id":"/garage/Usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Usage#lost-vehicles","content":"`LostVehicles.Garage`"},"570":{"id":"/garage/Usage-27","page_id":"/garage/Usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Usage#lost-vehicles","content":"Where the car goes"},"571":{"id":"/garage/Usage-28","page_id":"/garage/Usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Usage#lost-vehicles","content":"`'impound'`"},"572":{"id":"/garage/Usage-29","page_id":"/garage/Usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Usage#lost-vehicles","content":"To your impound garage. The player is told *A vehicle of yours was recovered and taken to the impound*. With no impound garage, it behaves like `'last'`."},"573":{"id":"/garage/Usage-30","page_id":"/garage/Usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Usage#lost-vehicles","content":"`'last'`"},"574":{"id":"/garage/Usage-31","page_id":"/garage/Usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Usage#lost-vehicles","content":"Back to the garage it was taken from, the next time the owner opens that garage's terminal."},"575":{"id":"/garage/Usage-32","page_id":"/garage/Usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Usage#lost-vehicles","content":"A car is **left alone** when it still exists in the world, when a lift cycle is using it, or when another script has impounded it (state `2`)."},"576":{"id":"/garage/Usage-33","page_id":"/garage/Usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Usage#lost-vehicles","content":"Want to know why a certain car was not recovered? Turn on `Debug` and open the terminal. The server console prints one reason for every car it skipped."},"577":{"id":"/garage/Usage-34","page_id":"/garage/Usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Usage#good-to-know","content":"Garages only work in the **default routing bucket** (bucket `0`). Players in an instance can't use a terminal."},"578":{"id":"/garage/Usage-35","page_id":"/garage/Usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Usage#good-to-know","content":"One lift runs **one cycle at a time**. Other players see *Someone else is using the lift* until it is done."},"579":{"id":"/garage/Usage-36","page_id":"/garage/Usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Usage#good-to-know","content":"If a player leaves or the server restarts in the middle of a cycle, the script remembers it and finishes it safely once a player is near the lift again, so the car ends up back in storage."},"580":{"id":"/garage/Usage-37","page_id":"/garage/Usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage/Usage#good-to-know","content":"Everyone nearby sees and hears the lift move, the shutters open and the car come up."},"581":{"id":"/garage","page_id":"/garage","type":"page","content":"Getting Started","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Garage"],"tags":[],"url":"/garage"},"582":{"id":"/garage-0","page_id":"/garage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/garage","content":"Install Evolent Garage on your server."},"583":{"id":"/garage-1","page_id":"/garage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/garage#installation","content":"Installation"},"584":{"id":"/garage-2","page_id":"/garage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/garage#install-dependencies","content":"Install dependencies"},"585":{"id":"/garage-3","page_id":"/garage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/garage#download-and-extract","content":"Download and extract"},"586":{"id":"/garage-4","page_id":"/garage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/garage#database","content":"Database"},"587":{"id":"/garage-5","page_id":"/garage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/garage#configure","content":"Configure"},"588":{"id":"/garage-6","page_id":"/garage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/garage#add-the-ace-permission","content":"Add 